#. ja: ●こんにちは。何か聞きたいことでも？
#. de: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Guten Abend<else>Guten Morgen</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Guten Tag<else>Guten Abend</if></if>, womit kann ich dienen?
#. fr: Bien le <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>bonsoir<else>bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>bonjour<else>bonsoir</if></if> chez vous, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if>. Que puis-je faire pour vous aider<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $gn4>lady<else>lord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_TALK_ACTOR:1"
msgid "Greetings, my <if $gn4>lady<else>lord</if>. Is there aught you wish to know about the Fashion Report?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: アタシは、ローズさんのアシスタントのカスミですっ！<br>ファッションチェックに興味があるようでしたら、<br>まずは「マスク・ド・ローズ」さんと話してみてくださぁ～い！
#. de: Ich bin Kasumi, die Assistentin von Maskierte Rose. Wenn du dich für seine Kleiderkritik interessierst, solltest du erst mal mit ihm sprechen.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! Je suis Kasumi, l'assistante personnelle de monsieur Masked Rose. Au cas où vous seriez intéressé<if $gn4>e</if> par la Revue de mode, n'hésitez pas à vous adresser à lui<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>lady<else>lord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_TALK_QUEST_INCOMPLETE:1"
msgid "Greetings, my <if $gn4>lady<else>lord</if>. If you wish to challenge yourself in the Fashion Report, I invite you to speak with Masked Rose. I am but his humble assistant."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何を聞く？
#. de: Was möchtest du fragen?
#. fr: Sur quoi vous renseignez-vous<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDEMENU_000_000:1"
msgid "What would you like to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ファッションチェックについて
#. de: Wie funktioniert die Kleiderkritik?
#. fr: La Revue de mode
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDEMENU_001_000:1"
msgid "What is the Fashion Report?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 採点について
#. de: Wie wird bewertet?
#. fr: Le système de notation
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDEMENU_002_000:1"
msgid "How am I judged?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 報酬について
#. de: Was für Preise gibt es?
#. fr: Les récompenses
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDEMENU_003_000:1"
msgid "What are the prizes?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Nichts.
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDEMENU_CANCEL:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: マスク・ド・ローズさんの出すテーマに従って、<br>参加者がファッションを整えて、採点を受ける……。<br>それが、「ファッションチェック」ですっ！
#. de: Maskierte Rose stellt jede Woche ein modisches Thema, zu dem sich die Kandidaten entsprechend kleiden und dann von ihm bewerten lassen.
#. fr: Le principe de notre Revue de mode est très simple<nbsp>: les par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants doivent s'habiller en suivant les directives de monsieur Masked Rose ici présent, qui leur donnera ensuite une note selon un système d'évaluation bien précis.
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDE_001_000:1"
msgid "The Fashion Report is a challenge unlike any other at the Gold Saucer. Each week, Masked Rose issues a theme to which you are to attire yourself. You then go before him for judging."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ローズさんは一流のファッション評論家なだけあって、<br>ここだけの話、採点はとっても辛口なんですぅ……！<br>だから、一番自信のある服装で挑戦することをオススメしまぁ～す！
#. de: Herr Rose ist ein Ausnahmekritiker und - ganz unter uns - sein Urteil ist ziemlich streng. Du solltest die Veranstaltung nicht aufs leichte Schulterpolster nehmen.
#. fr: Entre nous, monsieur Rose est cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment un des critiques de mode les plus respectés dans la profession, mais il faut bien admettre que son jugement peut parfois être assez sévère. Soyez sur votre trente-et-un en toutes cir<shy>cons<shy>tan<shy>ces pour vous attirer ses bonnes grâces<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDE_001_001:1"
msgid "Be fairly warned: as a leading critic in the field of fashion, Masked Rose does not mince words. Rather, he tears participants to shreds with his barbed tongue. That aside, folk seem to enjoy the experience. The prizes on offer certainly help to soothe the pain."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ファッションチェックのテーマは、<br>（地球時間）毎週<reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>曜日の<if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時に更新されます。
#. de: Das Thema der Kleiderkritik ändert sich jede Woche am <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch> um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr (Erdenzeit).
#. fr: Le thème de la Revue de mode est réinitialisé tous les <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>dimanches<case>lundis<case>mardis<case>mercredis<case>jeudis<case>vendredis<case>samedis</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).
#. macro: <reset-time 17 2> — sets the time placeholders to the next daily or weekly reset; hour = 17, weekday = 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = day of the week of the set time, 1 for Sunday (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_SYSTEM_001_002:1"
msgid "The theme of the fashion challenge is updated each week on <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> at <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time)."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、ファッションチェックの採点は、<br>（地球時間）毎週<reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>曜日の<if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時以降から、<br>次の<reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>曜日の<if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時までの期間中に計4回、挑戦できます。
#. de: Von <reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch> um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr bis <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch> um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr (Erdenzeit) kannst du dich bis zu vier Mal in Augenschein nehmen lassen.
#. fr: Il est possible d'obtenir jusqu'à quatre évaluations par semaine en vous présentant devant Masked Rose des <reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>dimanches<case>lundis<case>mardis<case>mercredis<case>jeudis<case>vendredis<case>samedis</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h aux <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>dimanches<case>lundis<case>mardis<case>mercredis<case>jeudis<case>vendredis<case>samedis</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).
#. macro: <reset-time 17 5> — sets the time placeholders to the next daily or weekly reset; hour = 17, weekday = 5 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = day of the week of the set time, 1 for Sunday (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <reset-time 17 2> — sets the time placeholders to the next daily or weekly reset; hour = 17, weekday = 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_SYSTEM_001_003:1"
msgid "You may submit yourself for judging up to four times each week between <reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> at <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> and the following <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch> at <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time)."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なお、（地球時間）毎週<reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>曜日の<if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時から、<br><reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>曜日の<if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時までは、準備期間のため、<br>ファッションチェックに挑戦することはできません。
#. de: Den anderen Teil der Woche gönnt sich Maskierte Rose seinen verdienten Schön<shy>heits<shy>schlaf. In dieser Zeit findet keine Kleiderkritik statt.
#. fr: La période des <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>dimanches<case>lundis<case>mardis<case>mercredis<case>jeudis<case>vendredis<case>samedis</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h aux <reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>dimanches<case>lundis<case>mardis<case>mercredis<case>jeudis<case>vendredis<case>samedis</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h est réservée à la préparation des par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants. Il est donc impossible d'être évalué durant cette période.
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_SYSTEM_001_004:1"
msgid "The Fashion Report is unavailable outside of these times."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 採点は、100点満点で評価されますっ！<br>１テーマにつき、最大4回までチャレンジできるから、<br>一度うまくいかなくても、めげずに頑張るといいと思いまぁ～す！
#. de: Bewertet wird auf einer Skala von 1 bis 100 Punkten. Pro Thema kannst du vier Mal antreten. Also Kopf hoch, wenn es beim ersten Mal nicht sofort klappt.
#. fr: Vous pouvez vous présenter devant monsieur Rose jusqu'à quatre fois par semaine. Pour chaque évaluation, il vous attribuera une note sur cent points. Par conséquent, n'hésitez pas à vous présenter plusieurs fois durant la période d'évaluation pour obtenir le meilleur score possible.
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDE_002_000:1"
msgid "Participants are judged on a scale of one to one hundred. Even if you do not score well at first, do not lose heart, for there are more opportunities to impress. To be precise, you may present yourself for evaluation four times per challenge."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ファッションチェックの採点では、<br>武具投影をしている場合は、投影後の姿の装備で採点されます。<br>また、頭装備が非表示の場合も採点対象に含まれます。
#. de: Die Bewertung erfolgt für die angewendeten Projektionen, nicht für die eigentliche Ausrüstung. Auch wird die Kopfbedeckung stets mit bewertet, selbst wenn sie ausgeblendet sein sollte.
#. fr: Veuillez noter que si des mirages ont été appliqués, l'évaluation se basera sur l'apparence actuelle de votre équipement. En outre, votre couvre-chef sera également évalué, même s'il est caché.
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_SYSTEM_002_001:1"
msgid "Please note that glamoured gear is evaluated based on its glamoured appearance. Headgear is also subject to judging even when set to hidden."
msgstr ""

#. ja: １テーマごとに、１回でもファッションチェックに参加すると、<br>チャレンジしてくれたことへのご褒美として、<br>MGPをプレゼントしちゃいまぁ～す！
#. de: Jede Woche erhältst du für deine erste Teilnahme MGP als Belohnung.
#. fr: Même si vous ne tentez votre chance qu'une seule fois au cours de la durée d'un thème, vous recevrez des PGS en guise de récompense. C'est notre façon de vous remercier pour avoir fait un minimum d'efforts.
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDE_003_000:1"
msgid "Simply participating once in any fashion challenge will earn you a sum in MGP. 'Tis our little way of encouraging and thanking you."
msgstr ""

#. ja: さらに、80点以上を獲得できたときには、<br>ボーナスで、ドカッと大量のMGPをプレゼント！<br>高得点目指して、ぜひがんばってくださぁ～い！
#. de: Solltest du mehr als 80 Punkte erreichen, gibt es noch mal einen ordentlichen Bonus obendrauf. Also streng dich an, es lohnt sich!
#. fr: En revanche, ces mêmes PGS pleuvront sur votre tête en quantité astronomique si vous obtenez un score supérieur à quatre-vingts. Voilà pourquoi vous devez faire votre maximum pour être à la pointe de la mode en permanence<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDE_003_001:1"
msgid "The serious rewards, however, begin when you achieve a score of eighty or above. In this case, you can look forward to a veritable bounty of MGP!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: それと、ファッションチェックに頻繁に参加してくださる方は、<br>特別な景品を交換できるようになりまぁ～す！<br>ですので、ガツガツ挑戦してくださいねっ！
#. de: Die Teilnahme an der Kleiderkritik berechtigt außerdem zum Einkauf besonderer Waren. Du siehst, es gibt Gewinner auf allen Seiten!
#. fr: De plus, tous les par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants réguliers à la Revue de mode auront accès à des articles exclusivement réservés aux habitués. Rendez-nous visite aussi souvent que possible pour découvrir de quoi il s'agit<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/004/CtsFckAttendant_00454:TEXT_CTSFCKATTENDANT_00454_GUIDE_003_002:1"
msgid "Furthermore, regular challengers will also have access to unique prizes via exchange. So you see, there is no reason not to participate! ...Unless your ego is too fragile to survive Masked Rose's withering words, that is."
msgstr ""
